      <description>
&lt;h2 dir="auto"&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 dir="auto"&gt;New&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul dir="auto"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add the abstract command line to create and drive chats by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5574346310" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/3" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/3/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/3"&gt;#3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;feat: smarter git actions and PR pane, ⌘↩ send button, narrower side tabs by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5577009270" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/5" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/5/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/5"&gt;#5&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;feat: pin chats to the top of their project, fix right-click on tabs by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5577134084" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/6" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/6/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/6"&gt;#6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automations run in chats; standalone chats; set up chats before their agent by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5577307311" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/7" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/7/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/7"&gt;#7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast, uncut text boxes and a / command menu in the composer by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5585622380" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/9" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/9/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/9"&gt;#9&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Submodules: review each repository on its own, and ship them safely by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5619907717" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/10" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/10/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/10"&gt;#10&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Submodules: update, pull, commit and push the repository you're working in by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5630176855" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/13" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/13/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/13"&gt;#13&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Control Mac chats from iPhone and Android by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5641528289" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/16" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/16/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/16"&gt;#16&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect to paired Macs over the internet by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5652036078" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/23" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/23/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/23"&gt;#23&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 dir="auto"&gt;Fixed&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul dir="auto"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make chats that abstract creates usable in the app right away by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5584184370" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/8" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/8/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/8"&gt;#8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change a project's default agent, permission policy and base branch in Project Settings by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5634180081" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/15" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/15/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/15"&gt;#15&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile chat connects to Macs faster and handles reconnects cleanly by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5648770891" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/18" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/18/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/18"&gt;#18&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Don't block every push on a repository with no upstream and no base by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5650896359" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/20" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/20/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/20"&gt;#20&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy relay to an existing one-node Lightsail service by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5652043047" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/24" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/24/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/24"&gt;#24&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy the exact relay image registered in Lightsail by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5652480609" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/25" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/25/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/25"&gt;#25&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 dir="auto"&gt;Agents&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul dir="auto"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add OpenCode, retire Ollama/LM Studio as agents, per-agent defaults, composer fixes by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5576375970" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/4" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/4/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/4"&gt;#4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Count OpenCode's tokens and cost in Usage by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5646194047" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/17" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/17/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/17"&gt;#17&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 dir="auto"&gt;Other changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul dir="auto"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tickets go through Linear triage before the roadmap by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5620593168" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/12" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/12/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/12"&gt;#12&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 dir="auto"&gt;Under the hood&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul dir="auto"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add the weekly roadmap agents deliver against by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5620049304" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/11" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/11/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/11"&gt;#11&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Group release notes into features, fixes, agents and internals by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5630449293" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/14" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/14/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/14"&gt;#14&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add manual deployment for the internet relay on Lightsail by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5651444046" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/21" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/21/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/21"&gt;#21&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan the roadmap in Linear, where every ticket is reviewed before it's built by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5651668640" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/22" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/22/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/22"&gt;#22&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allow the idle agent test more time on busy CI runners by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/wesguirra/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/wesguirra"&gt;@wesguirra&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5662730838" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/issues/28" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/endeken-com/abstract/pull/28/hovercard" href="https://github.com/endeken-com/abstract/pull/28"&gt;#28&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
